      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.09522273391485214
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 45,
      "text": "No where it has been suggested that she was not taken to villages 6 2026:HHC:10185 Bani, Pred and Kagrod, which are villages of applicants Gulsher Ahmad, Haneef and Nazeer Ahmad, respectively.",
