      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.036542538553476334
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 46,
      "text": "For aforesaid material on record .\nplea raised by the applicants that they were not aware about the age of minor as well as they had not given shelter to Taliv Hussan, prima facie, appears to be contrary to record.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 7747,
      "end": 7961,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Taliv Hussan",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 7901,
          "end": 7913
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.08862720429897308
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 47,
      "text": "9. In Section 16 of POCSO Act in third clause, it has been of provided that who intentionally aids, by any act or illegal omission, the doing of that offence, is a person who abets an offence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "STA",
      "start": 7963,
      "end": 8155,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 16",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 7969,
          "end": 7979
        },
        {
          "text": "POCSO Act",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 7983,
          "end": 7992
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.11296336352825165
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 48,
      "text": "Explanation-II in rt this Section provides that whoever, either prior to or at the time of commission of an act, does anything in order to facilitate the commission of that act, and thereby facilitates the commission thereof, is said to aid the doing of that act.",
      "rhetorical_role": "STA",
      "start": 8156,
      "end": 8420,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.09340298175811768
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 49,
      "text": "In present case it has come on record that after knowing that victim was minor, applicants gave shelter to Taliv Hussain to keep the minor with him in their houses.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 8421,
      "end": 8585,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Taliv Hussain",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 8528,
          "end": 8541
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.25098806619644165
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 50,
      "text": "Thus their act and illegal omission to report to the concerned authority or Police about kidnapping of minor, but instead allowed them to take shelter with them, prima facie,\nindicate that applicants are persons who abets the offence in reference and liable to be punished under Section 17 of the POCSO Act, which provides punishment for abatement with mandate that a person shall be punished for abatement with punishment for that offence, which has been abetted.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 8586,
      "end": 9050,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 17",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 8865,
          "end": 8875
        },
        {
          "text": "POCSO Act",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 8883,
          "end": 8892
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24585606157779694
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 51,
      "text": "7 2026:HHC:10185 10.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 9051,
      "end": 9072,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
